# The published tarball and the repository must stay byte-identical: a consumer
# comparing an installed copy against this repo should find no difference, and a
# Windows checkout that rewrites LF must not be it. Every file here is LF, so
# `eol=lf` makes checkout reproduce exactly what the tarball ships.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary by nature; never normalise or diff them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tgz binary
